config U30PRO_SPRD_THM_R5P0
 bool "UMS9632 SoC thermal sensors (R5P0 IP)"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && THERMAL_OF && NVMEM && COMMON_CLK
 help
   Reads the on-die temperature sensors (two R5P0 blocks, eight sensors each) with the efuse calibration and registers them
   with the thermal framework, so the zones of the stock device tree appear in /sys/class/thermal and as hwmon devices.
   Ported from the vendor driver; the hardware over-temperature shutdown thresholds are programmed as the vendor does.

config U30PRO_SPRD_THM_VIRT
 bool "UMS9632 virtual thermal sensors (SoC and CPU cluster temperature)"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && THERMAL_OF
 help
   Provides the "soc-thmzone" (highest of the core and GPU zones) with the passive trips that throttle the CPUs through the cpufreq
   cooling devices, and the cluster zones the apcpu cpufreq driver reads.  Needed before the cpufreq driver is switched on.

config U30PRO_SPRD_THM_SHELL
 bool "UMS9632 shell (case surface) temperature estimators"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && THERMAL_OF
 help
   The frame, front, back and bkchg zones: estimates of the case temperature calculated from the seven board NTC zones (see
   drivers/unisoc_platform/thermal_sensor/u30pro_sprd_shell_thm.c).  Needs GENERIC_ADC_THERMAL for the NTC zones.

config U30PRO_UMP96XX_TSENSOR
 bool "UMP96xx PMIC TSX crystal temperature for the modem (modem_tsen)"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && MFD_SC27XX_PMIC
 help
   Provides /sys/bus/platform/drivers/ump96xx-tsensor/modem_tsen (m°C), the temperature of the TSX crystal that the stock RIL
   sends to the CP (AT+SPTSXTMP) before every protocol stack start on crystal=7 boards.  Port of the vendor normal-boot path.
